left.raw_text:
Inclusion Criteria:
  -  Adult  [AND] (18 years of age or older) with the diagnosis of essential thrombocytosis, [OR]  prefibrotic myelofibrosis  [OR] or overt myelofibrosis according to WHO 2016 criteria;
  -  Patient who has not received specific treatment for neoplasms;
  -  Patient who has signed the consent to participate in the study;
  -  Patient who has consented to be included in the "Malignant Haemopathies" collection at the University Hospital of Angers  [OR] or Brest and for whom the samples necessary for the study are available in the biocollection

right.raw_text:
Exclusion Criteria:
  -  Patient with another hematologic neoplasm  [OR] or progressive cancer at the time of diagnosis;
  -  Patient with a diagnosis of secondary myelofibrosis;
  -  Pregnant  [OR] or breastfeeding woman;
  -  Person prived of liberty by judicial or administrative decision;
  -  Person subject to a legal protection measure;
